        "accession_number": "0001288469-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Because our products often are building block semiconductors which provide functions that in some cases can be integrated into more complex integrated circuits, we also face competition from manufacturers of integrated circuits, some of which may be existing customers or platform partners that develop their own integrated circuit products.",
        "start_character": 45833,
        "end_character": 46174
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001288469-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001288469-26-000011-fbe1f0dff918c3fd",
        "accession_number": "0001288469-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "By providing a highly integrated reference design solution that our customers can incorporate in their products with minimal modifications, we enable our customers to design cost-effective high-performance SoC-based solutions rapidly.",
        "start_character": 31608,
        "end_character": 31842
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001288469-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001288469-26-000011-fbe1f0dff918c3fd",
        "accession_number": "0001288469-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For certain customers, we sell multiple products into disparate end user applications such as PON outdoor units, or PON ODUs, Wi-Fi routers, broadband gateways, and cable modems.",
