        "filing_date": "2026-01-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe our expertise and track record of successfully developing widely deployed, reliable embedded protocols for networking applications are essential to the evolution of connected home products of the future.",
