        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We compete with both established and development-stage semiconductor companies that design, manufacture and market analog and mixed-signal broadband RF receivers, high speed interconnects, high-performance interface, data and video compression and encryption, and power management products.",
